#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:2 28a3dd41bfd842e590c82d243ad7dd05
msgid "_`Conanfile Configuration`"
msgstr "conanfile 配置"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:5 b41c47dd837447c78e55b900f88eefa5
msgid "_`Usage`"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:7 ee6ee3e0db6b4ce0aed9a7e806929bcf
msgid ""
"conanfile.py is the Conan recipe of food_volume_measure. It declares the "
"requirements, prepares the build files, and defines the package that "
"conan create exports."
msgstr ""
"conanfile.py 是 food_volume_measure 的 Conan 配方。它声明依赖、准备构建文件，并定义 conan "
"create 导出的包。"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:11 8e71a8317bf944b7b59d582f39c8e3c4
msgid "_`Main Features`"
msgstr "主要特性"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:13 719228a8c5b4415da87c7159b92d2a93
msgid "Loads the package metadata and the requirement list"
msgstr "读入包元数据和依赖列表"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:14 06a2f22d4f14482090345c10aa12e935
msgid "Dependency selection for regular, bare-metal and test builds"
msgstr "按常规、裸机和测试构建分别筛选依赖"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:15 5e35b5e932cd425cb302d92d4cb101b0
msgid "Generates the CMake toolchain and wires in the dependencies"
msgstr "生成 CMake toolchain 并接入依赖"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:16 6ec759014ed74f4e940239cbed1ffadb
msgid "Optional C++ module generation"
msgstr "可选的 C++ 模块生成"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:17 3f2f5b0ce2884e3c89618b9385301487
msgid "C header compatibility for C consumers"
msgstr "让 C 代码也能使用 C 头文件"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:18 0bd3e12ee05d45f092f3558ad079044a
msgid "Checks the built archives for ABI mismatches before packaging"
msgstr "打包前检查产物有没有 ABI 不匹配"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:21 bbe358260245409abae5929f6d1a896f
msgid "_`Core Functionality`"
msgstr "实现要点"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:23 a1db235ebe074c9498a2a80c68f2ad6a
msgid ""
"PackageRecipe reads the package metadata from metadata.json and the "
"requirement list from conandata.yml. gtest is left out of the runtime "
"requirements because only the tests need it, and pybind11 is pulled in "
"only while enable_python_bindings is on. In a bare-metal cross build, "
"only the packages listed in baremetal_white_list are kept."
msgstr ""
"PackageRecipe 从 metadata.json 读入包元数据，依赖列表取自 conandata.yml。gtest "
"只在跑测试时用得到，所以不进运行时依赖；pybind11 只在 enable_python_bindings 打开时才引入。裸机交叉构建只保留 "
"baremetal_white_list 里列出的包。"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:28 3e8eae6562d64c689da18003ba21d6ac
msgid ""
"generate() writes the CMake toolchain and the dependency files. The four "
"dependency buckets of metadata.json (common, c, cpp and infra) are merged"
" and written into the C_DEPS and CPP_DEPS variables as Pkg@Targets "
"entries, which is the form CMakeLists.txt expects. A bare-metal build "
"keeps only the whitelisted entries and switches "
"CMAKE_TRY_COMPILE_TARGET_TYPE to STATIC_LIBRARY. The module preprocessing"
" step reads the export and attach markers and turns the exported .hpp and"
" .cpp files into C++ module units; C headers get extern \"C\" guards so C"
" code can include them."
msgstr ""
"generate() 写出 CMake toolchain 和依赖文件。metadata.json "
"的四个依赖分桶（common、c、cpp、infra）合并后，以 Pkg@Targets 的形式写进 C_DEPS 和 CPP_DEPS "
"变量，正是 CMakeLists.txt 需要的格式。裸机构建只保留白名单里的项，并把 CMAKE_TRY_COMPILE_TARGET_TYPE"
" 改成 STATIC_LIBRARY。模块预处理会读取 export 和 attach 标记，把需要导出的 .hpp 和 .cpp 转成 C++ "
"模块单元；C 头文件则加上 extern \"C\" 保护，让 C 代码也能包含。"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:36 59de3616d2394986925722c5a89a21bd
msgid ""
"build() runs the CMake flow, and _validate_built_archives inspects the "
"resulting archives with ar and readelf to catch an ABI mismatch. The "
"float ABI and FPU settings come in as compiler flags rather than Conan "
"settings, so package_id also hashes tools.build:cflags and "
"tools.build:cxxflags. Without that, two MCUs with the same architecture "
"string but different ABIs would share one cached binary and only fail at "
"link time."
msgstr ""
"build() 跑 CMake 流程，_validate_built_archives 用 ar 和 readelf 检查生成的静态库，发现 "
"ABI 不匹配。float ABI 和 FPU 设置是以编译选项而不是 Conan settings 传入的，所以 package_id 也会把 "
"tools.build:cflags 和 tools.build:cxxflags 纳入哈希。否则 arch 字符串相同但 ABI 不同的两颗 "
"MCU 会共用同一份缓存二进制，直到链接时才报错。"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:42 f752ccfaf981432a9f45f0c7f6c54f53
msgid ""
"package() and package_info() then say what is exported and how consumers "
"link against it."
msgstr "最后 package() 和 package_info() 说明导出什么，以及使用者该怎么链接。"

